      "html": "<p>A golden Apteronotus leptorhynchus has recently arrived from Colombia. The \"Brown Ghost\" is regularly stocked, but this is the first time a specimen with such a unique coloration has been seen.</p><p>Lexicon: Apteronotus: ancient Greek, means \"with no fin on the back\". leptorhynchus: ancient Greek, means \"with a small snout\".</p>"
